<title>USA: Dow Chemical found negligent in Louisiana trial.</title>
<headline>Dow Chemical found negligent in Louisiana trial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A state jury in a class-action lawsuit on Monday found Dow Chemical Co. was negligent in testing silicone for use in human implants and conspired with Dow Corning Inc.</p>
<p>The jury deliberated less than two days following five months of jury selection, trial testimony and courtroom skirmishes as Dow Chemical attorneys tried to have the trial stopped or transferred to Michigan.</p>
</text>
